| `temperature-blanket-colorways-api` | [Official API terms and license](https://temperature-blanket.com/api/yarn-colorways#terms--license) | `attribution-only` | Brand/yarn/colorway names and IDs, weight ID, provenance URL/date, unavailable status/date; hex also exists | Exclude hex, imagery, marketing, review, ranking, price, affiliate metadata. API calls require an approved RapidAPI credential. | 2026-10-31 |
| `wikidata-structured-data` | [Wikidata licensing policy](https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Wikidata:Licensing) | `redistributable` | Structured labels, descriptions, relationships, concepts, identifiers | Structured namespaces only; coverage must be measured before use as a catalog source. | 2027-01-31 |

### Temperature Blanket S2 field allowlist

Allowed:

- `brandId`, `brandName`
- `yarnId`, `yarnName`
- `yarnWeightId` and weight name from `/weights`
- colorway `name`
- `dateAccessed`
- source `href`
- `unavailable`, `unavailableDate`

Excluded:

- `hex`, `delta`, `percentMatch`, and other color-derived fields
- all images, logos, marketing copy, reviews, rankings, prices, offer information, and affiliate-link metadata

Required attribution should be materially equivalent to:

> Yarn colorways from temperature-blanket.com, licensed under CC BY 4.0.

Include a link to the license and indicate transformations. Do not imply endorsement.

