## Exact primary citation register

All locators below are normal URLs suitable for ERI reacquisition. Access timestamps are UTC.
Quoted fragments are intentionally short; the report's conclusions rely on the linked full pages.

### 1. Temperature Blanket Yarn Colorways API

- **Rights page:** <https://temperature-blanket.com/api/yarn-colorways#terms--license>
- **Data endpoints:**
  - <https://yarn-colorways.p.rapidapi.com/v3/colorways>
  - <https://yarn-colorways.p.rapidapi.com/v3/brands>
  - <https://yarn-colorways.p.rapidapi.com/v3/yarns>
  - <https://yarn-colorways.p.rapidapi.com/v3/weights>
- **Coverage UI:** <https://temperature-blanket.com/yarn-colorway-finder>
- **Accessed:** `2026-07-31T15:21:45Z`
- **Exact evidence:** “Data is provided under … CC BY 4.0”; commercial sharing and adaptation are expressly allowed with attribution.
- **Freshness evidence:** API v3 was introduced 2026-04-09; the current finder displayed 261 yarns and 14,087 colorways at access time.
- **Rights/field separation:** The license clears the API data. The field allowlist still excludes hex values because the source describes them as approximations.

